    {
      "id": 230795,
      "name": "Escher",
      "username": "Escher",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/escher/{size}/4865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-05-27T22:20:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For what it's worth, just my opinion, in a writer's room, I'd rather hear a complete story than a single issue.&nbsp;If you do a single issue that is a complete stand-alone story, that's great.&nbsp;If you tell us about a six-issue arc, that's great too.&nbsp;I don't care how many issues it&nbsp;technically covers&nbsp;or how in-depth page-by-page you get; I enjoy it either way as long as it's a good piece of storytelling.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:05:53.612Z",
